anthra_FSt Revision History
---------------------------

2026-11-14: Version 1.0.0

- Port of anthra_1920_FSt 20140324 by Tomas Saxer to text2skin 2.0 (skin
  format 1.2) under the new name anthra_FSt.
- screenBase abs1920x1080: the skin scales itself to the size of the OSD.
- The build options of Make.config are options of the skin, set at runtime
  in the setup menu of text2skin: channel logos and their path, separator
  logos and their path, main menu logos, main menu font, timer info in the
  main menu, blinking running recordings, EPG and recording images, signal
  display, scroll indicator, divider between menu items.
- EPG images and recording images from a scraper plugin (tokens
  {PresentPoster} and {RecordingPoster}).
- All windows true colour (bpp 32).
- The video size is shown for UHD as well, the info line of a recording
  reaches up to its image (both from the Debian package).
- Makefile: the skin file is put together from xml/*.xml, directories from
  vdr.pc, option titles and values in the translation template. Removed:
  Make.config, the generated skin file, the old RelaxNG schema, compiled
  translations.
- Translations in UTF-8, options translated into de, es, fi, fr, it, nl.
